# Replay mock data + mobile UI (default)

Use **worker replay fixtures** for frontend/UI work unless the user requests live ingestion. See `AGENTS.md` (Install, UI screenshots) for the full command list.

## `.dev.vars` (auto-applied by `./scripts/cursor-cloud-setup.sh`)

- `DATA_SOURCE=replay`, `REPLAY_FIXTURE_SET=canonical`, `CLOCK=2026-01-20T15:00:00Z`
- Opt out of live overwrite: set `DATA_SOURCE=live` in `.dev.vars`
- Custom fixture set / clock: set `REPLAY_FIXTURE_SET` or `CLOCK` explicitly — bootstrap only fills **missing** keys

## UI stack

1. `npm run dev:worker`
2. `VITE_API_URL=http://127.0.0.1:8787 npm run dev:web`
3. `curl -fsS http://127.0.0.1:8787/__pipeline/run/ingestion` if the feed is empty
4. `npm run snapshot` (mobile iPhone 13, `http://localhost:5173` default)

Regenerate PR screenshots: `npm run docs:snapshots` → `docs/screenshots/`

## Live data

Only when the user asks: `DATA_SOURCE=live` plus real `CONGRESS_API_KEY` / `GOVINFO_API_KEY`.
